  "question": {
    "text": "Coefficient of kinetic friction between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> block is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math>. The horizontal table surface is smooth. Find the acceleration (in S.I unit) of the block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/425308_squeee.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 173px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Adding the above three equations and solving for acceleration we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
